<title>USA: ComCast names Cellular Group president.</title>
<headline>ComCast names Cellular Group president.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comcast Corp said it has named David Watson president of its Cellular Division.</p>
<p>Watson, 38, has been senior vice president - sales and marketing since 1993 and has been with the company for 11 years.</p>
<p>Watson will replace Donald Harris, who is resigning to pursue other interests.</p>
